  "EEE-hee! Just hanging around! Your golden friend went thataway!": '24b63671920d116c.mp3',
  "Each cloud goes boing like a trampoline \u2014 two moon-gazing spots appear on the next cloud bank. Toadstool or telescope?": 'efc49d7d3dc1ee2f.mp3',
  "Each geode half went ZING under Pip's paws like the world's most extra stepping stones, and halfway across his amethyst shard hummed a note so pretty the whole bridge hummed back. Jade ledge or coral archway?": '827ae83e3ef15b6c.mp3',
  "Each mushroom cap BOUNCES like a trampoline and Willow nearly lost her hat twice \u2014 she grabs the humming singing reed from the mud and tucks it in her hat band because anything that sings might be useful later. Fog island or cypress cathedral?": '3a5cb374a067da9a.mp3',
  "Each mushroom step went BOING under Mo's feet, and the little beetle giggled on his shoulder like a tiny motorcycle. Cocoon hammock or bark ladder?": '5fb8da497ab11062.mp3',
  "Each seed becomes a bell-flower, and each bell-flower finds its own perfect note. The great bell tree joins in last, deep and warm, and the Moonrise Song plays itself \u2014 not because anyone forced it, but because Luna helped something new grow. The End!": '76d64b905d1e1526.mp3',
  "Each step BONGED under Rex's feet and the wind-chime jingled the cancel-note just in time \u2014 but the ground at the bottom keeps rumbling and that armadillo barricade looks VERY intentional. Armadillo barricade or rust cave?": '74810b4a6bd1430b.mp3',
