  "Even the bugs brought kites today \u2014 mine is painted right on my back!": 'e2c5fe71284561e2.mp3',
  "Every blossom popped open like popcorn and puffed Mo higher, and from the very top he could see the sunrise painting the whole world in marmalade and strawberry. The End!": '26cfb0aeb9938f9d.mp3',
  "Every boat in the regatta is lined up, but the river keeps shoving Pip sideways like a bossy dance partner! Racing buoys or willow archway?": 'b390d937f7fc2afe.mp3',
  "Every fox statue seems to be watching Luna from the corner of its stone eyes which is VERY unsettling for a garden and the moonstone pebble flashes bright blue whenever she turns toward the center \u2014 something is definitely hiding here. Bronze gong or moss mound?": 'd61ca5a229ddbf50.mp3',
  "Every geode was whispering a tiny WOOF and Pip's ears kept swiveling like satellite dishes because those woofs sounded EXACTLY like his \u2014 is this quarry seriously a Pip jukebox? Sapphire geode or calcite tower?": '97def5f7d0622d92.mp3',
  "Every kite at the festival is dancing in the sky \u2014 every kite except Pip's. He tugs and tugs, but his patched kite just flops on the grass like a tired pancake. Wind-sock or tent?": '6d95b1caec752664.mp3',
  "Every leaf Pip grabs, the wind steals two more! Then a hedgehog tumbles out of a leaf-gust like a tiny spiky tumbleweed, looking extremely embarrassed.": 'c3abfb175e3ffb78.mp3',
  "Every pumpkin Pip rolled into the barn sneaked right back out \u2014 tonight's harvest-moon party has zero decorations! Red barn or signpost?": 'bfef2dafae9585ac.mp3',
  "Every ring lands PERFECTLY and the prize tower dings so loud the Carnival King comes running \u2014 he hands over the banner and begs Nova to teach him that throw at the village festival.": '9dcc639e3d23e609.mp3',
  "Every road just stopped. The tiny paintbrush whispered that it had painted Luna's door with its very last drop of color, betting everything on a unicorn with a rainbow mane. Amber lantern or magenta arch?": '416c9a98cf75327f.mp3',
  "Every stalactite drip made a tiny PLINK that the grotto turned into a full orchestra, and the amethyst shard in Pip's collar hummed along like the world's tiniest conductor \u2014 this place is DEFINITELY hiding something sparkly. Crystal cluster or quartz arch?": 'c92e2f35958978a9.mp3',
  "Every step goes SCHLORP \u2014 Mo's feet stick to the gumdrop cobblestones like sneakers on a movie-theater floor. A tiny jellybean creature hands him sparkly sugar-dust slippers and beams, 'They're non-stick!'": '0926484b568c3a78.mp3',
  "Every step played a BONNNNG under Pip's paws like a crystal xylophone and his bark came back as a KAZOO \u2014 honestly an improvement over quacking \u2014 while the citrine pebble practically bounced on his collar. Teal boulder or amber shelf?": '131fd4436fa66f69.mp3',
  "Every washing machine looks like a robot face staring at Pip which is not creepy at ALL and hanging from a dryer handle he finds a brass bell that makes the prettiest chime when he taps it \u2014 into the satchel because musical things are always important in stories. Tin roof path or bathtub?": 'a67a593605f14e8b.mp3',
