  "Frogs drive cars!": 'c7792245fcef4368.mp3',
  "From the crane top Milo can see everything the dark has swallowed, which tonight is everything. Even the lighthouse is out, and lighthouses are famously the one thing that never is.": '3ce60de24fc0c562.mp3',
  "From the crown of the bell tree, Luna swishes her rainbow tail \u2014 left, right, down, UP \u2014 and the entire forest plays as one. The frog's deep bass, the cricket's fiddle, the owl's hoot: perfect harmony. The moon rises to the most beautiful song the forest has ever sung, conducted by one small tail. The End!": '3983db49c3eea79a.mp3',
  "From the ledge Milo spots it \u2014 foxfire, on the far hilltop! The tengu spreads his great fan. 'One gust, small cat. Or trust your own paws.' Fan-glide, or the moonlit path?": 'dd0c396e505f93eb.mp3',
  "From the ledge Nova can see the dark beacon at the very top AND a sheltered cave where she could catch her breath \u2014 the wind gremlins are circling above like tiny angry helicopters. Mountain cave or summit trail?": '874213643a394172.mp3',
  "From the ridge Pip could see Briarwood's clock tower in the valley below \u2014 so close! The sheep trooped behind like the world's fluffiest conga line.": '04c661e7bc377242.mp3',
  "From the top, Pip sees everything \u2014 even an old shipwreck on the beach! A zipline zooms right to it. And... is that a coconut catapult? Choose, Pip!": '35060142e0d139e6.mp3',
  "From this moonlit balcony Milo can see the whole clockworks, and there, scurrying along a brass beam, is the golden cog! The grateful owl flutters up and points its wing toward two shortcuts. Bell jar or emerald lever?": 'a0a306aef71de3d5.mp3',
  "From up here Luna can hear the whole forest breathing \u2014 every creature down there is a note waiting to be played. Two places below are practically begging for a conductor.": 'be38127086c5d5ff.mp3',
  "From up here Luna can see the lost puffin boats and one lonely little cloud \u2014 hurry! Bottle or pail?": '01a354a1d199b603.mp3',
  "From up here Luna could see the whole world \u2014 painted patches floating in an ocean of white nothing! Her jar of blue paint caught the wind and hummed. Brown chest or violet telescope?": 'e2aa37b6b27011e7.mp3',
  "From up here Mo can see the volcano's belly literally jiggling \u2014 it's not angry, it's being tickled. Little furry shapes are digging right at its base.": '4e6b6ec9e2045800.mp3',
  "From up here Pip can see everything \u2014 the pumpkins are not being naughty, they just really want to watch the moon! Patchwork quilt or cider crate?": '49987ff8e3e2bba3.mp3',
  "From up here the desert looks small and the oasis looks close \u2014 because a tortoise the size of a hill makes everything a short walk. The fox is doing victory backflips! The End!": '97a9cb28173d1a6b.mp3',
  "From up here the whole frozen bay looks like it is holding its breath, and Luna spots slow dark shapes drifting just under the ice. Telescope or bell?": '08e143aa67b31c65.mp3',
  "From way up here Mo spots the parade route \u2014 and gasps! The gingerbread bridge has cracks spreading across it like a broken windshield, and his candy-cane stick is the only thing keeping him balanced.": '150267dea1036793.mp3',
