  "Grandma's cat Pumpkin has been crying inside this creepy manor for THREE days and the rooms rearrange themselves when you look away \u2014 Willow heard a meow from upstairs and spotted a corridor sneaking along the side. Grand staircase or brick corridor?": 'b4f8655741d65023.mp3',
  "Grandma's prize melon is STOLEN \u2014 and dawn is only ten lanterns away! The thief left dango paw prints heading two ways. Which way, Detective Milo?": '765b8f0e569b38b2.mp3',
  "Granny's eyes went wide \u2014 first at her birthday boy, then at the parade of sheep who had appointed themselves the official welcoming committee. Best birthday surprise in Briarwood history. The End!": '4e367f99eca3fd7d.mp3',
