  "Halfway across, Luna noticed the river below was only pencil lines \u2014 not even colored in! The bridge itself was losing purple at the far end, fading to white. Yellow lantern or pink crystal?": '8970c125c9472ea1.mp3',
  "Halfway up, Mo spots a little marmot dropping a pinecone \u2014 Mo catches it and tucks it safe in a pocket. The volcano grumbles again and two ways forward appear.": '9e3a7e3ef287a8b7.mp3',
  "Halfway up, a little rain sprite sits dripping under its own grumpy cloud. Luna shares her warm mane. 'Nobody EVER shares,' it sniffles happily. Cotton garden, or swan boat?": '5f80206dfb9646e3.mp3',
