  "In Scaring Class, Principal Growlbert teaches BOO 101. Mo's scary face just looks... adorable. The supply closet wobbles \u2014 someone tiny in there is giggling too!": 'ae2e15ff885e26fb.mp3',
  "In the cave \u2014 a baby ANGLERFISH, not a glowfish! She thought Mo's lantern was the moon. Glowworm agrees: 'Guide her home!' Snuggle her to the glow-nest, or wave the lantern crab over?": 'a977a8a7aec2d060.mp3',
  "In the forest, a little squirrel waves hello. 'Will you play with me today?'": '386e44308ef18153.mp3',
  "In the frosty pantry shivers a baby comet. 'I hid till my sparkle froze wobbly,' it chatters. Luna wraps it in her mane; the cook brings warm pudding. The wobble melts into the prettiest zigzag \u2014 and it zooms up to light the ball! The End!": '001346941a8bd0a9.mp3',
  "In the garden, the fog moves like it's alive. The cellar door groans open by itself. Something breathes down there.": 'cf7f639f2274b7e7.mp3',
  "In the hollow nothing moves \u2014 not one leaf, not one blade of grass. Pip could shout for the wind or build something cozy instead. Megaphone or basket?": '3113ed237777bc20.mp3',
  "In the library the whispers are LOUD now. The big chair creaks. Something's tail twitches behind it... and a kind voice hoots: 'Who-o-o wants a story?'": 'a17c240fdf3bbe85.mp3',
  "In the mirror gazebo every wall replayed a moment from Luna's adventure, and behind every pane Mirror-Luna pressed close, eyes wide with hope. The moon was almost up.": '73ab34026f0d179a.mp3',
  "In the square, a hungry crow eyes Milo's last dumpling. He shares it, and the crow caws a big thank-you. The trail forks \u2014 jasmine garden, or mochi lane?": 'b39bbd1afe174319.mp3',
  "In the tent: crumbs, crumbs, and \u2014 a tiny yellow feather! 'The thief is small, fluffy, and possibly adorable,' Pip deduces. Pumpkin stall, or orchard gate?": 'c1a37d50f2a15724.mp3',
  "In the wobbly cradle hides the baby comet, sniffling sparkles. Luna hums grandma's lullaby, low and soft. 'Your wobble sounds like dancing,' she whispers. The comet peeks... smiles... and rises glowing to light the whole castle. The End!": '84e52078ecac1d6a.mp3',
  "Inside lives Madame Plume, a pigeon who maps the whole city in chalk, including three noodle shops that no longer exist. She taps two secret routes into the clock tower and whispers that the dark is only the city holding its breath.": '540ee2f4bcf44f36.mp3',
  "Inside the locker, the gear ranged from too-big to way-too-big \u2014 except for one curious little yellow vest tucked in the back like it had been waiting for someone exactly Pip's size.": 'ed3545b3398db1ab.mp3',
  "Inside the mill: five ducklings fast asleep around the last cookies, guarded by one tired mama. 'They followed the star shapes home,' she whispers. Pip stands watch till morning, then leads the parade back for breakfast and fresh baking. Detective AND hero. The End!": 'f628f858a5d951e2.mp3',
  "Inside the tent Pip finds a soft quilted scrap \u2014 could come in handy! Now something shiny dangles on one side and something boxy waits on the other. Bell or crate?": '4638c1a9cc44e155.mp3',
  "Inside the willow roots: the tidiest little cookie pantry in the kingdom. 'We were saving them for winter,' says mama duck, offering Pip the first one back. 'Winter is in EIGHT months,' says Pip. They compromise: everyone marches to the bakery to bake more. The End!": '98703cbab14c8fde.mp3',
  "Inside, glowworms light the cave like tiny lanterns. A crystal tunnel sparkles purple and pink, and a little red row boat rocks on an underground stream. Which way to the treasure?": 'd65cb5e6d19d5dc9.mp3',
