  "It is NOT her cousin singing \u2014 it is the CAVE! The entire grotto is a living coral creature and it has been singing to lure sea-dragons here for warmth because it is LONELY. The glow lantern in Pearl's satchel is pulsing like a heartbeat and the grotto's huge gentle face looks so sad. Coral alcove, crystal spire, or moonlit pool?": '5c894341d44a2383.mp3',
  "It takes three tries, two squeaks, and one hilariously flat note, but when those four baby birds finally lock in \u2014 oh! The bell tree bursts into golden bloom and the Moonrise Song pours out like sunrise made of sound. Turns out the youngest voices ring the truest. The End!": '3081f232c3ddb7e5.mp3',
  "It was a tight squeeze and the acorn cap scraped the ceiling, but Milo popped out center stage, flame first, while the firefly took a bow \u2014 every wick in the village caught the glow, and the Rain Festival roared to life. The End!": '9f7de1a90e424473.mp3',
