  "Open the stone door": 'fc6b9a9cd0986d09.mp3',
  "Open the supply closet": 'f1c5d8d135fa1ba0.mp3',
  "Open the yellow gate": '43d60f83dd5e4375.mp3',
  "Orchard crumbs \u2014 the thief snacked here too. Tidy little bites. The apple basket rocks... and the lavender trembles... 'Both suspicious,' whispers Detective Pip. Basket, or bushes?": '36c7df6f9366c031.mp3',
  "Out the tunnel \u2014 WONDER! On one side a jelly grove glows like paper lanterns. On the other, a purple coral castle with pointy towers. Which way?": '978f01f0a911cf12.mp3',
  "Over the rainbow bridge": '30c6b019c5f3de46.mp3',
  "Over the windmill hill": 'c4a2b55dce0029ed.mp3',
  "P!": '4a108e84890d7960.mp3',
