  "Rex SCREECHED so hard the pipe shot sparks and every armadillo curled into a ball and rolled offstage \u2014 stalactites cracked, the echo got SCREECHY too, and somewhere in the caves the eggs were vibrating like maracas. NOT the counter-frequency. Oopsie ending!": '3246c6f51bcbc9f6.mp3',
  "Rex STOMPED so hard the drumstone cracked clean in half and he tumbled straight into a sand dune \u2014 the echo bounced off the broken stone TEN TIMES HARDER and now every armadillo is giving him the stink-eye from behind their tiny helmets while he spits out sand. Turns out the counter-frequency is NOT a stomp. Oopsie ending!": '3cb9f4396fdf5495.mp3',
  "Rex blew that bass horn and a RUMBLE so deep it made his bones buzz rolled through the amphitheater \u2014 every armadillo nodded, the captain taught him the secret gentle counter-hum, and Rex walked out humming so softly not a single egg even wobbled. The End!": '6de45a9659cdda43.mp3',
  "Rex blew that horn and the armadillo captain whipped out a HARMONICA \u2014 together they played the counter-frequency so beautifully the whole canyon hummed along, the echo melted, the eggs stopped shaking, and Rex learned the best roar is sometimes a duet. The End!": '90078bbe6ab66440.mp3',
  "Rex dipped the singing stone and the pool sang the gentlest hum \u2014 the Echo Stone LISTENED, the trapped roar melted away like butter on a hot rock, and the armadillo captain saluted from the entrance because NOT A SINGLE EGG CRACKED. Gentle beats loud every time. The End!": '405b9bf2e3a53e73.mp3',
  "Rex hummed the softest deepest lullaby a dinosaur ever hummed and the golden egg GLOWED \u2014 every egg in the cave stopped shaking, the armadillo captain cried actual armadillo tears, and she taught Rex the exact counter-frequency because anyone who hums THAT gently deserves to save the canyon. The End!": '3f026f0ec5308967.mp3',
  "Rex opened his mouth to yawn and out came the BIGGEST accidental roar that ever roared \u2014 now it's bouncing off every canyon wall and getting LOUDER. He has to reach the Echo Stone and roar the counter-frequency before the whole desert shakes apart! Slot canyon or mesa arch?": 'd869333d066840c7.mp3',
  "Rex squeezed that cactus and out came the TINIEST most ridiculous squeak \u2014 armadillos laughed so hard they fell off their seats, the echo hiccupped and shrank, and the captain was laughing too hard to be grumpy anymore! The counter-frequency to a big scary roar is one very silly squeak. The End!": '49fcce56ca5953d6.mp3',
  "Rex tiptoed like a champion but his tail had OTHER PLANS \u2014 THWACK went the platform and eggs rolled everywhere like the world's most stressful bowling alley! Rex spent the rest of the afternoon returning eggs to nests while armadillos supervised with VERY judgmental expressions. Oopsie ending!": '50be4c32cf2fdfb7.mp3',
  "Rex's jaw DROPPED \u2014 armadillo EGGS everywhere, and they're shaking with every echo-bounce! No WONDER the armadillos are so grumpy about noise. The wind-chime is keeping things calm but Rex needs to be super careful. Big golden egg or spotted eggs?": 'bb21e1bd9f89d4bf.mp3',
  "Rex's mega-roar hit the Echo Stone so hard every wall in the canyon CRACKED and the echo got TEN TIMES LOUDER \u2014 now there are a HUNDRED roars bouncing around like the world's worst concert and Rex is going to need a LOT more singing stones. Oopsie ending!": '88f86fda4896ecc0.mp3',
  "Rhyme master! Great ears!": '7d4489ee55318533.mp3',
