  "Someone has been crossing out stars on the maps \u2014 the SAME ones vanishing from the real sky! A trail of fresh quill ink leads deeper inside.": '560a831755abdf6a.mp3',
  "Something deep in the caves is SINGING and it sounds exactly like Pearl's lost cousin who vanished into these caves last full moon \u2014 the tide is rising and the caves flood chamber by chamber, so standing here debating is NOT an option. Crystal tunnel or coral passage?": '6d04c8b440033eee.mp3',
  "Something is HOWLING from the deepest part of the scrapyard and it sounds like a puppy in trouble \u2014 Pip's ears are standing straight up and his tail is wagging because rescuing things is his absolute favorite activity especially when it is midnight and slightly terrifying. Car canyon or appliance alley?": 'caad6a7fe81bea83.mp3',
  "Something warm breathes under this bay and that snow mound just puffed a tiny cloud, while the whale chart shows a big smiley note right at this spot. Starfish or snow mound?": 'c294e93e2500a36b.mp3',
  "Sometimes the fastest way to the oasis is a surprise slide off a tortoise you did not know you were standing on! Mo pours, the flowers wake, and the fox takes a nap in the petals. The End!": '0fb87cdcf15c8ace.mp3',
  "Somewhere deep in this sparkly quarry hides the legendary echo gem \u2014 the ONE crystal that barks back a PERFECT bark instead of the garbled meow-quack-kazoo nonsense the regular crystals spit out. Pip's tail is already wagging at competition speed. Amethyst tunnel or citrine passage?": '70bd79715e9bfa62.mp3',
