  "Through the kite tree": '04f20208b0756a67.mp3',
  "Through the lens Milo spots the moon-mice setting a long checkered table \u2014 he just needs one last ride up. Paper airplane or cannon?": 'a5bb48ae518b9f10.mp3',
  "Through the periscope Milo spots the cog doing a jig on a chandelier far above \u2014 a hidden passage opens into a glittering gear cathedral! The mouse on his shoulder chatters with excitement as two paths branch ahead. Onyx pedal or garnet cradle?": '6d50c272b5c993a0.mp3',
  "Through the telescope Luna could see forever \u2014 and at every distance Mirror-Luna was looking right back. It was like the world's longest staring contest, and neither of them wanted to blink.": '868f1c2ac4f1676d.mp3',
  "Through the telescope Luna spots... baby stars! They fly right up to snuggle her on the moon balcony. Goodnight, little stars. The End!": 'd070d2c657882043.mp3',
  "Through the telescope Pip spotted Granny's garden gate and a shortcut no map had ever noticed. He burst through parcel-first with a flock of uninvited but wildly enthusiastic guests tumbling after him. The End!": '997a110c8ecd8d1d.mp3',
