  "Turn the ruby wheel": 'c929b47d34e40b3b.mp3',
  "Turns out dry leaves and rainstorms go together like sandcastles and waves \u2014 one fat drip and Milo's flame fizzled out while the beetle offered a very slow six-legged clap. Oopsie ending!": '960277bfec9c82f0.mp3',
  "Turns out hedgehogs are allergic to diplomatic seesaws \u2014 who knew? Every leaf landed in the neighbor's garden and Pip had to start over from scratch. Oopsie ending!": '8fb2b45aead57d5b.mp3',
  "Turns out the stream led to Lily Pad Pond \u2014 a lovely spot with zero train stations and maximum confusion. Pip and the sheep floated in gentle circles until well past cake o'clock. Oopsie ending!": '7bf4a3e92af6aa85.mp3',
  "Tweet tweet!": '5339e93d2d731af2.mp3',
  "Twist the dimmer dial": 'bd30461df2641a3d.mp3',
  "Two giant eels are having a WATER-SQUIRT SHOWDOWN right in front of the only two tunnels deeper \u2014 the cyan one guards the high tunnel above water and the magenta one guards the low tunnel underwater. The glow lantern makes them both pause and blink. Pick a side!": 'e566f0724496d09a.mp3',
  "Two player mode is on!": '343a53a1f523b685.mp3',
  "U!": 'd689980531162011.mp3',
  "UP the chimney! Pip skids down onto the cupcake and BECOMES the frosting. Icing whiskers, icing tail. Baker's helper of the year! The End!": 'd505bd3fcbb3b1d0.mp3',
  "Under a billion stars the dune almost looks like a sleeping animal \u2014 if animals were the size of apartment buildings. Spyglass or mushrooms?": 'd8ec9e79112aa9ff.mp3',
  "Under the arch Pearl finds a little pearl wedged in the coral that SINGS when she touches it \u2014 a single clear note that makes the star-seed pulse brighter, so into the satchel it goes alongside the star-seed. Kelp garden or anemone cluster?": 'aa14e3daeb89b559.mp3',
  "Under the arch Pip's tiniest sniff echoed into a WHOOSH and his amethyst shard glowed pink and sang a note so clear it sounded like his OWN bark from last Tuesday \u2014 and that amber ledge is glinting like the world's biggest butterscotch. Emerald stalagmite or amber ledge?": 'f46dcef30e97d641.mp3',
  "Under the basket: one mama duck, five ducklings, three cookies, zero regrets. 'We got lost, and the stars were the only thing that felt like home,' says mama. Pip walks them home to the pond \u2014 right past the bakery, where a warm new batch is already rising. The End!": '531912d2fee1c15b.mp3',
  "Under the engine, Pip found a tiny pink squeaky mouse and tucked it into his collar \u2014 finally, something in this station that was actually his size.": '14f9d2db1bcf67ec.mp3',
  "Under the ledge Mo finds a secret grotto \u2014 and the baby marmot starts squeaking toward the shadows. Something furry is definitely moving in there.": '4c5090d3f7a529ed.mp3',
  "Under the mesa arch Rex's echo bounced so hard pebbles rained down like confetti at a VERY loud party \u2014 but that terracotta wind-chime jingled the OPPOSITE sound and canceled the echo for one beautiful second. Rex grabbed it. Sienna staircase or red slot canyon?": 'd458bf652abd3412.mp3',
  "Under the old oak the brook sings a lullaby and two things wait as if someone left them on purpose. Pinwheel or cushion?": '3ffa8cdb5fee8fa1.mp3',
  "Under the porch: five ducklings, one cookie pile stacked like a glowing star. 'Our nightlight went out,' peeps the smallest, 'and these look like it. Also they are delicious.' Pip melts. Fresh cookies get baked, ducklings get adopted by the bakery. Case closed! The End!": '68018db4d9f573f8.mp3',
  "Under the rainbow arch": 'bbd87d5536fc68cb.mp3',
  "Under the whale bones": '98f6ce54191faaef.mp3',
  "Under the whale rib": 'ba898d062deb3fb0.mp3',
  "Under the whale ribs \u2014 it's a baby ANGLERFISH, not a glowfish! And she's stuck in a net! The whale-ghost hums a lullaby. Even the bubbles hush. Sing along to loosen the knots, or tug the tangled net free?": 'd83cab19a5986786.mp3',
  "Under the willow the silver leaves chimed a lullaby, and Mirror-Luna sat below reaching up through the water with a hopeful little wave. It was hard to be scared of someone who looked that lonely.": '01d2eacb648cec28.mp3',
  "Unicorn starts with yoo!": '07a4089881fdb95d.mp3',
  "Unicorn!": 'b3c15bbe74e4afce.mp3',
