  "Unlock the purple chest": '1ad66d63ceafc82c.mp3',
  "Unroll the star chart": 'fd8fb3f55d01053a.mp3',
  "Up the flour mountain \u2014 carefully, CAREFULLY \u2014 the webbed prints march to a little moon window. But the warm oven door glows too, and thieves love warm. Window, or oven nook?": '6d90147b924dba92.mp3',
  "Upstairs, a music box plays all by itself... and the door at the end of the hall RATTLES. Then a soft voice purrs: 'Milo? Is that you, little one?' It's Great-Grandcat!": 'c0d90291fe1ed0ad.mp3',
