  "WHEEEEE \u2014 the frosting slide launches Mo straight into a mountain of sprinkles! His sugar-dust slippers kept his feet safe, but the rest of him looks like a disco ball at a birthday party.": 'd11c7a9154c9bd10.mp3',
  "WHOOSH \u2014 the fan-wind sets Milo down soft as a leaf. The fox bows: 'Your grandma's lantern is the bravest. My little friend just needed to borrow its courage.' Milo lends his own tiny lantern instead \u2014 a buddy! The parade begins. The End!": '3a163f2348fece09.mp3',
  "WHOOSH \u2014 up the geyser! Pip is CONFETTI-COVERED and completely turned around. Star-jar giggles. The pink cupcake cliff drifts past far away. Second-to-last, but the sparkliest. Oopsie ending!": '28012281807ce3f0.mp3',
