  "Wait \u2014 the fountain is playing the SAME song the lanterns have been humming this whole time and the bamboo walls are swaying like they want to dance \u2014 maybe the trick is not to look harder but to LISTEN. Follow the song or push through the thicket?": '4cba8b53c78c9f44.mp3',
