  "What a forest adventure! Luna slides all the way home on a rainbow. Sweet dreams, Luna! The End!": '0bf192c37832014f.mp3',
  "What a ride \u2014 the barrel bumps right against the lighthouse! Anchor or buoy?": '64bf6fe434d0f44f.mp3',
  "What a ride \u2014 the whale winks and launches Milo toward two cozy perches near the moon. Coral tower or mushroom cap?": 'eabcede8c59fc306.mp3',
  "What animal makes this sound?": 'a76da69a8ba06f0d.mp3',
  "What should happen next?": 'f43acb0c237024d5.mp3',
  "Wheee goes the porcupine! While he rolls, Mo watches the truth unfold \u2014 the moths carry star-seeds to dark spots and PLANT them into a new constellation shaped like Mo's own village. The porcupine wakes, sees the sky, and sobs with joy.": '0f975984c4401164.mp3',
  "Wheee \u2014 TOO fast! The slippery silver slide plops Luna SPLAT into a puddle. Muddy mane! Straight home for a bath. Oopsie ending!": '3b008c978c38f824.mp3',
  "Wheee! At the bottom waits a shiny golden ball \u2014 the map's treasure! And it's rolling away!": 'f5a4b3eddf30d764.mp3',
  "Wheee! I was napping in that mushroom \u2014 best alarm clock ever!": '3093931cd7075429.mp3',
  "Wheee! Pip lands on a real pirate ship! The captain's wheel has a paw print on it... and a parrot in a tiny hat squawks 'Pieces of kibble! Pieces of kibble!' What should Pip try?": 'e0d0eb548b8f9941.mp3',
  "Wheee! Save me a cracker, will you?": '83671f7f963cd35a.mp3',
  "Wheee! The slide lands in a candy-cloud valley. A rainbow ferris wheel spins slowly, and a cozy cloud cottage puffs warm little smoke rings. Where to now?": '69fcd9a1535a2a2c.mp3',
  "When every light went out, the universe switched on. The wandering star vanished \u2014 just a reflection, gone with the glow. But the porthole became pure window, and through it Milo saw more stars than he had whiskers, and rising beneath them all, Earth, shining its own quiet, steady, uncatchable light. The End!": '233198295cf26d1a.mp3',
